{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2006-meet-science2-35","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2006,"subject":"physics","number":35,"points":null,"unitId":"physics-fluid-thermal","unitLabel":"유체·열역학","topic":"단열·압력·엔트로피","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["physics-fluid-thermal"],"stem":"그림은단열재로만들어진상자의두공간A와B에각각1 몰의\n이상기체가들어있는것을나타낸것이다. A와B는금속판과\n단열판에의해나뉘어져있다. A와B의부피는각각V 와2V,\n온도는각각T 와2T 이다.\n금속판은남겨두고단열판을제거하여A와B가부피의변화없이\n동일한온도가될때, 이에대한설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서\n모두고른것은? (단, 금속판과단열판의부피는무시한다.)\n<보기>\nㄱ. A와B는온도가1.5T 인열적평형상태에도달한다.\nㄴ. 온도가변하는동안A의압력은감소한다.\nㄷ. 온도가변하는동안B에있는이상기체의엔트로피는항상\n증가한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":605,"height":220,"region":0,"bbox":[43.155,89.388,242.0,88.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-meet-science2-35/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":765,"height":215,"region":0,"bbox":[13.555,258.188,306.0,86.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2006-meet-science2-35/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":11,"sourceRect":[429.645,151.412,758.256,544.055],"width":328.611,"height":392.643,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[43.155,89.388,242.0,88.0],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[13.555,258.188,306.0,86.0],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"35. 그림은단열재로만들어진상자의두공간A와B에각각1 몰의","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.42,11.995],"spans":[{"text":"35.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,16.282,11.995